  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1014.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2017-04-24",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1014.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to provide the process by which the department shall issue limited privilege licenses to certain persons convicted of a first offense under RSA 265-A:2, I, when a court has ordered the restoration of the person’s operator’s license, pursuant to RSA 263:57-b.\n\nSource. #12020, INTERIM, eff 10-26-16, EXPIRES: 4-24-17; ss by #12162, eff 4-24-17); ss by 13685, eff 8-5-23 (formerly Saf-C 1015.01) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 1000)",
